      "side": 1,
      "message": "**Type Mismatch in Callback Signature:** In `util/elan/iapcontrol.h`, the setter method and the member variable have conflicting type signatures for the callback:\n\n```c\nvoid setProgressCallback(std::function\u003cvoid(int, int)\u003e callback); // Declaration\nstd::function\u003cvoid(size_t, size_t)\u003e m_progressCallback;           // Member\n```\n\n  Furthermore, in `iaptool.cc`, the implementation function `setProgressBar` uses `size_t`. This mismatch will cause compilation errors or warnings. Standardize on `size_t` for all progress-related variables to represent byte counts accurately.",
